{"seq":4,"slug":"new-development-philosophy","title":"新发展理念","stage":"DONE","category":"xi-jinping-thought","categoryLabel":"习近平思想","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/03_xi-jinping-thought/04_new-development-philosophy","introMarkdown":"# 新发展理念 简介\n\n新发展理念是习近平经济思想的核心内容，以创新、协调、绿色、开放、共享五大理念为引领，深刻回答了新时代中国实现什么样的发展、怎样实现发展的重大问题。本知识库从理念体系、落地实施和经济思想三个维度展开系统分析，帮助读者全面把握新发展理念的理论内涵与实践逻辑。\n\n本知识库适用于研究中国经济政策的学者、参与经济决策的党政干部、经济学与公共管理专业的师生以及关注中国经济转型的观察者。\n\n第一章**理念体系**深入解读五大发展理念的各自内涵与内在联系。分别阐述创新发展的引领作用、协调发展的平衡要求和绿色发展的底线思维，揭示五大理念如何构成一个相互贯通、相互促进的有机整体。\n\n第二章**落地实施**聚焦新发展理念从理论转化为政策实践的关键领域。围绕供给侧结构性改革的深入推进、构建新发展格局的战略部署以及高质量发展的目标路径展开分析，展现理念指导实践的具体过程。\n\n第三章**经济思想**从更宏观的视角梳理习近平经济思想的理论脉络。涵盖经济新常态的判断与应对、双循环新发展格局的形成逻辑以及数字经济的战略布局，呈现新时代中国经济治理的思想全景。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章建立对五大理念的系统认知，再结合第二章了解政策实践，最后在第三章中将具体理念融入经济思想的整体框架。建议关注各理念之间的关联性，避免孤立理解单一理念。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-system","title":"理念体系","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/philosophy-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innovative-development","title":"创新发展","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/philosophy-system/innovative-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coordinated-development","title":"协调发展","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/philosophy-system/coordinated-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-development","title":"绿色发展","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/philosophy-system/green-development"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"落地实施","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-side-reform","title":"供给侧改革","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/implementation/supply-side-reform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"new-development-pattern","title":"新发展格局","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/implementation/new-development-pattern"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-quality-development","title":"高质量发展","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/implementation/high-quality-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"economic-thought","title":"经济思想","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/economic-thought","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"new-normal","title":"新常态","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/economic-thought/new-normal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dual-circulation","title":"双循环","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/economic-thought/dual-circulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-economy","title":"数字经济","url":"/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/new-development-philosophy/economic-thought/digital-economy"}]}]}